<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Lak</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Lak are an Iranian tribal people of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zagros-mountains">Zagros Mountains</a> of western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/karim-khan-zand">Karim Khan Zand</a>, founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zand-dynasty">Zand Empire</a>, came from a Lak branch of the Zand tribe. Lak tribesmen formed part of the Zand military alongside <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bakhtiari">Bakhtiari</a> and other allied tribes.</p></div>
